- **High/medium anchor:** `/home/wg25r/review_agent/human_reviews/WoGnnggVCZ.md` (avg 6.25). Also about synthetic data for vision tasks; despite some novelty concerns, it was accepted because the empirical story was more straightforward. KnowData has interesting gains, but the main evidence here is less cleanly attributable to the claimed source.
