- High-score empirical anchors like `/home/wg25r/review_agent/human_reviews/FtX6oAW7Dd.md` (7.50) and `/home/wg25r/review_agent/human_reviews/d8w0pmvXbZ.md` (8.00) show a level of experimental completeness and claim support this paper does not reach.

The closest calibration anchor is probably:
