So the calibrated outcome is **borderline but below threshold**: a good empirical method paper hidden inside an overstated paradigm paper. I would encourage acceptance only if the venue is comfortable rewarding strong empirical evidence on narrow tasks despite the confounded central framing; under standard ICLR standards, I land slightly on the reject side.

